WEBVTT

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.710
Is that the Death Omen Star?!

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.220
According to the Legend of the North Star,

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.980
only those fated to die can see it.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.750
If you see it you will 
most definitely die,

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.190
which is why it is a star you

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.660
must never see before going into battle.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.360
You could call it the symbol 
of the Angel of Death.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.300
Hey! Kon, what's up?

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.160
Just kidding!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:39.360
There's no way this world is going 
to have the Death Omen Star.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.950
Well, then! We've got a war to stop!

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:25.240
Run, run!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.040
It's no use!

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.920
I didn't think they had 
amassed such a force.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:35.540
It's over!

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.580
Yeah, idiot!

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.050
If you stop now, it's over.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.630
We may have turned into Hyperions,

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.010
but the four of us can't face this.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.010
I never thought I'd meet you here!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.330
I'm going to send you to 
the other side myself.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:49.780
Who are you?

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:50.520
It's me.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:54.350
Big brother!

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:55.070
What?

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.440
We're under attack!

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.480
Run!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.610
Why did this happen?

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.650
The part where we wanted 
to go tell Nabokov to stop the war

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:08.930
because we were all screwed 
by the Ulga Sorority was fine.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.390
Even the part about the 
nose hair being planted,

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:11.950
being screwed by that nose hair,

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:13.860
that nose hair that snaked out...

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.690
Stop saying nose hair!

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:18.740
I told you that we should go covertly, 
but this old idiot here...

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.800
<i>We're Hyperions!</i>

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.030
<i>We're forcing our way through!</i>

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:27.340
I never thought that
 an army like that would be here.

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.370
It's not just Jugglaburk's 
forces, but also

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.080
all the anti-empire forces 
from the surrounding lands

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:32.870
and mercenaries, as well.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.110
They're really going to 
strike back at the empire.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.150
We can't hope to persuade them.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:40.630
My big brother is a 
mercenary for Jugglaburk.

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:42.700
I can't fight my own brother.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.740
Hey, hey!

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.030
If you go all soft like 
that, you're dead!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.080
Let's keep our eyes forward 
and think about our next step.

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.700
We must stop the empire.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:53.210
I'll do the talking.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.030
Run, run!

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:03.470
It's no use!

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:06.890
You dare stand in my way?

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:10.390
I am Ecarlate Juptris St. Piria.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.730
I am a princess of the empire!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.100
Get out of the way!

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.400
I cannot let you pass, Ecarlate.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:22.280
You have become a hindrance.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:25.950
Big brother?

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.070
What?

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.200
This is an excellent chance to 
annex the Jugglaburk Territorium.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.960
And now you will disappear, Ecarlate!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.780
Retreat!

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.410
I can't win against my big brother.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:43.470
Hey, being all weak isn't like you.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:47.400
I suppose the empire sees 
this war as an opportunity.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.400
This is general mobilization.

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.720
They really are preparing for war.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.750
At this rate, everything will go 
according to the archbishop's plan.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.480
What if we eliminate 
the archbishop himself?

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.260
That's the only thing we can do.

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:07.150
I never thought the cult's 
forces would be this strong!

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.710
We've got to break through!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.030
That again?

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:14.090
I didn't think I'd be meeting you here.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.360
I'm going to finish you off myself!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:20.790
Big brother!

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:21.880
What?

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.030
Retreat!

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:27.220
My own big brother...

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:30.040
Hey, I know it's called trial 
and error for a reason.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:33.370
I know that success can be born 
out of failure, but come on!

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.300
If we keep failing like this...

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.600
We're going to die! 
We're seriously going to die!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.150
Big brother...

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.380
My brother...

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:40.930
Big brother.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:42.320
I told you to knock that off!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.140
You're just attracting 
all the negative vibes!

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:45.610
We've got to think 
positive and look ahead!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:48.320
If we stop this war we won't 
have to fight any of them!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:51.800
I'm very low in the 
line of succession...

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.570
It would probably be faster to 
count my place from the end.

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:57.070
I guess that's true.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:06:00.810
But I still want to stop the 
empire from collapsing, if I can.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.710
No matter what my 
older siblings are plotting.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.310
There you go! That's the spirit!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:10.420
Kon, I will now release you 
from your duties as my servant.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:11.970
What, out of the blue?

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.220
After all, you're my friend who 
will be fighting by my side.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.190
Hang on!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.440
In my world, what you're doing right now

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.790
is a surefire way to attract bad luck.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.630
That'll lead to a Sleggar situation.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.050
Just keep me as your servant.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.570
Don't say things like that.

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:27.700
Are you sure?

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:28.600
I am!

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.720
So just get back your normal energy.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.220
I don't want to see any more 
people getting hurt fighting.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.600
And the war will be so much worse.

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:38.250
We've got to stop it.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.560
That's it!

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:40.330
Hey, Kon.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.000
If we ever put a stop to this war...

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:42.980
Sis!

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.960
That phrase is taboo!

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.380
I want you to go tell my brother...

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.120
I'm currently not 
accepting any requests.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.160
Especially not deliveries or messages.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.220
There'll be death.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:56.210
Tell my brother that my very existence

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.790
has vanished from the 
surface of this world.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:59.480
Sis, you've blown right past the taboo phrase

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:01.400
and gone to the death phrase!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.560
Promise me.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:03.540
I won't!

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.860
Promises before battles are never good!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.440
I won't go for the top!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:08.110
No?

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.240
Nope! Your very existence won't 
vanish. It'll continue...

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.820
It'll continue, huh?

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:17.260
The ones that suffer the most in 
war are always the common folk.

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.000
Hey! Old man! What's happening?!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:21.210
Peace is the most important thing.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.060
Exactly, that's it!

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:26.370
I come from the grain belt in 
the southern part of the empire.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:31.240
During the harvest season, 
the view is absolutely spectacular.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:35.980
The harvest festival that 
follows is just wonderful.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:41.580
I haven't been back in years,
but it's so nostalgic...

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:44.690
You know, maybe I'll just go 
back there for a bit and—

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.360
Stop!

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.930
Old man, that's no good!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.610
You can't talk about stuff like that!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:53.160
I'm also trying to not remember 
my home right now, it's bad news!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.810
If you talk about stuff like 
that, you're going to die!

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:56.020
Is that how it works?

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:57.620
That's right, captain!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.540
Now, pick yourselves up!

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.540
If we kill more time 
here, then we'll

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.900
really be playing right into 
the archbishop's hands!

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:10.190
We, the Ulga Sorority, will do 
everything we can to support the empire.

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:18.430
We, the Ulga Sorority, will do everything 
we can to support the anti-empire forces.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:27.190
Everything is going according 
to plan, archbishop.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:33.480
However, those people are 
making some strange moves.

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:35.630
You mean Ecarlate and the Hyperions?

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.700
It seems that they appeared 
before the empire's forces,

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.410
the anti-empire forces, 
and our own forces.

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:45.080
Ixion is trying to meddle...

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:50.210
Well, let's not leave it unchecked. 
Send the Ulbrion squad for them.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:51.320
Yes, sir.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.830
There'll be war.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.260
I hope we won't get involved.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.510
You can't fight on an empty stomach.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:05.720
Well, we're trying to prevent the 
fighting, but let's eat anyway.

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:09.510
So, eat! Eat! Drink! Drink! Recover!

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.000
We've got to do it!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.610
Or we won't get to do it!

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:16.110
Yes, Kon's right.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.240
To think a servant could cheer me up.

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:20.620
Okay, let's eat!

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:22.580
But what are we going to do?

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:28.360
The one thing that's abundantly 
clear is that we're few.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.490
If we face those huge armies head on,

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:33.240
or try to force our way through, 
we'll just die, die, die.

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.720
So we have to think of some other way.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.720
What way did you have in mind?

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:42.540
I don't care if the historians 
will call us cowards or cheap.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.880
We're going to stop the war with 
methods that are not clean.

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:47.730
You guys are going to stop the war?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.940
That's our intention.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.700
Please stop it.

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:58.150
Leave it to us!

00:09:58.150 --> 00:09:59.070
Please!

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.700
Now the need to stop 
it is even more real.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:08.220
Huh? Was that a promise?

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:10.880
Naw, I'm sure that didn't count.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.470
Ah, my geta strap!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.880
Why are you wearing that anyway?

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:28.780
That's not even funny!

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:31.330
I get it! Is that it?

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.890
Is this bad atmosphere trying to subdue me?

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:35.980
Trying to make me fade 
away on the battlefield

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:37.370
while I still have my DT?

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:38.770
That's so lucky, Kon.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:39.990
A lucky omen.

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:45.750
What great luck! A black cat 
before going into battle!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:48.750
Huh? That's how it is 
here? The opposite?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:53.020
Well, I guess when in Rome...

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:55.130
All right, I guess we got lucky.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.640
What? Dog poop?

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:01.640
Oh well, I guess I'll just say 
the good luck's sticking to me.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:02.950
Be gone!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:03.990
Be gone!

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.310
Be gone!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.250
What are you doing?

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:10.970
Getting dog poop on your 
hand before battle?!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.620
A bad omen!

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.400
Huh? That's how it is over here?

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:15.660
Be gone!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:16.650
Be gone!

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.650
Be gone!

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:20.740
Is that some sort of ward 
or something? Really?

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.410
It's just dog poop.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.080
We're about to go into b-battle!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.510
And you wiped the dog poop from 
your hand off on the ground?!

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:29.040
You basically doubled your bad luck!

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.540
What? That's what happens here?

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:32.900
Be gone!

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.250
Be gone!

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.290
Be gone!

00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:39.340
Enough already. That's just 
superstition, a folk tale.

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:42.010
This is the story of the hero Eguas Gur

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:46.220
who was on his way to the battle 
of Ulkruks, 800 years ago.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:48.330
What? The origin of that superstition?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.230
Eguas Gur rushed to the battle of Ulkruks

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:54.030
with an army of 1000 men.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.060
Everybody was certain 
of his victory,

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:59.830
but due to the enemy's 
trap, he was defeated.

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.870
He had no other choice but to retreat,

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:03.980
but during this retreat he and his men

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:05.320
kept having terrible luck.

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:08.310
After losing 800 men, he realized that

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:11.990
this horrible luck could not be 
normal and went to a truthseer.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:14.300
There he found out 
that all this bad luck

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:15.920
stemmed from the fact that he,

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.570
Eguas Gur, touched dog poop and

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.160
wiped it on the ground before battle.

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:22.030
Right away, Eguas Gur 
performed the steps to rid himself

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:25.340
of that curse, and is said 
to have saved his life that way.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:29.290
Yeah, that might be 
what happened to Eduas,

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.580
but that doesn't mean I...

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.000
I'm so sorry! I hope you're not hurt!

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:37.610
Don't worry, that was the 
fault of his bad luck.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:42.970
So how did that Eduas rid 
himself of that curse?!

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.280
To do so, you need to wash 
your hand with pure water.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:46.300
But that water...

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.900
Hey, I got it for you. 
Put out your hands.

00:12:49.970 --> 00:12:53.900
It has to be water that a pure 
maiden has drawn herself.

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.020
Hey, Marian...

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.520
My heart is that of a maiden.

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:58.260
But Sis, you've got one!

00:12:58.260 --> 00:12:59.760
So what if I do?!

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:02.130
Or what, you think I should cut it off?!

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:06.100
Uh, I'm not really in a 
situation to discuss that,

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.090
and that's not the problem here!

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:10.320
The question is if that 
cure worked or not.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:18.170
Looks like it got even worse.

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:19.860
Where did this even come from?!

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:20.940
It's Olvidia!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:27.870
That's a poisonous spider!

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:30.500
We have to get you an 
antidote right away!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.830
Why is there a poisonous spider here?

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.980
You made your bad luck even worse.

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:36.750
At this rate you'll die before 
you even head for the battle.

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.250
I'm being swallowed by this 
horrible flow of things.

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:41.500
I can clearly see it myself.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.730
What should I do?

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:45.050
How can I escape this bad luck?

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.620
This is a story of the hero Kobayashi Geru

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:51.810
who set off for the Trogauger sea 
battle 800 years ago.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:55.650
If it's a long story, 
just tell me the cure, please.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:57.270
Kon! Hang in there!

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.350
This is bad!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:12.620
Special Unit Incognito, 
Captain Erecpyle Dukakis.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.670
I wish to speak to Archbishop Taulepton.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.750
The archbishop is currently 
not in the headquarters.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:21.060
Where is he?

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:23.700
That's confidential, so I...

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:25.120
Confidential?!

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.300
We're a special unit 
under his direct command!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.130
Connect me!

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.440
It's me.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:34.090
Here's our report: 
Ecarlate and her subordinates

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:36.790
have begun their effort to stop the war.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.230
How should we deal with it?

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:41.100
Leave that issue to us.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:44.110
But wasn't our order 
of knights founded

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:48.390
to deal with problems of this nature?

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:51.950
I want Incognito to stand by 
until you receive further orders.

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.330
Stand by?

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:55.900
That's an order from your archbishop.

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.840
Remember that I will not allow 
any intervention from you.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.350
Erec-sama!

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.540
I don't understand what 
the sorority wants.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.330
Could they be intending 
to cut us knights off?

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.010
They probably are.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.050
Variation!

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:17.720
You're badly wounded.

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:18.680
Who did this?

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.260
Ulbrion...

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:56.070
The sorority has revived 
an ancient technology

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:59.820
and has created the Ulbrion, 
essentially man-made Hyperions.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:03.650
So they've already got 
a replacement for us.

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:05.580
Variation!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.190
The sorority is fanning the flames in

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.260
both the pro- and anti-empire camps

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:13.110
and trying to gather the 
armies in Sarisariñama.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:17.430
The archbishop still has 
something hidden up his sleeve.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.210
Enough. Don't speak anymore, Variation.

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:22.260
Please listen, Erec-sama!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:26.360
The sorority's real ambition 
isn't to rule the world.

00:16:26.930 --> 00:16:30.340
It's to destroy it...

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:32.680
Variation!

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.300
Revive!

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:40.020
Variation!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.730
Gustave, you...

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:47.280
You know, I just did it based on 
a hunch, but I guess it worked.

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:49.870
Where were you until now?!

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:52.350
You know already, a hostess club.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:56.280
Since the preparations for the war 
have begun, they've all been shut down.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:58.330
Spit it out, Gustave.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:01.300
Where have you been, 
and what have you been doing?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:05.340
Were you maybe leaking information 
about us to someone?

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:06.600
Come on now, Leon.

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:07.250
Answer us!

00:17:10.020 --> 00:17:11.050
I...

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:13.380
...can't tell you.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.770
<i>As a knight, I can't tell them</i>

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.330
<i>that I was trying to negotiate for</i>

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:19.050
<i>an extension directly 
with the lawyer because</i>

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.820
<i>the child support payments to my wife,</i>

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:23.350
<i>who left me due to my hostess 
club addiction, were late.</i>

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:27.500
So basically, Gustave 
left to try to do something

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:30.150
about the child support 
payments to his ex-wife.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:33.580
Why are you telling them, damn it?!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:36.690
I was in the same boarding 
school as Caroline.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:39.160
She came to talk to me.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.460
Wait a second.

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:44.530
My wife went to a girls' school. 
Why were you there?

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:47.750
Why? Isn't that obvious?

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:50.340
I'm also...

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:52.730
I'm also...

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.470
...a woman!

00:17:56.650 --> 00:18:00.770
Huh?!

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:01.890
Oh, I knew.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.520
Huh?!

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:06.710
Well, I thought maybe you were hiding it.

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:09.320
I mean, when you get drunk, 
you're totally a chick.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:12.810
Even I, as the resident 
muscle-for-brains, kind of knew.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:15.240
But why did you pretend 
to be a guy anyway?

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:17.790
I wanted to be accepted.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:21.530
As a member of Incognito, 
as one of you...

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:26.290
KT, you've been one of 
us from the beginning.

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:31.810
But...

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:34.500
A woman...

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:36.090
But...

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:39.120
<i>Erec-sama, let me dry you off.</i>

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.390
<i>Oh, thank you.</i>

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:43.530
<i>Erec-sama, let me wash your back.</i>

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:44.680
<i>Oh, thank you.</i>

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.990
<i>Erec-sama, let me warm you.</i>

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.100
<i>Oh, thank you.</i>

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:50.680
But...

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:55.830
Emilia!

00:18:56.370 --> 00:19:00.330
I'll fulfill your wish.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:02.160
Really? You sure?

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:04.620
Yes.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.320
But I haven't stopped the war.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.730
I haven't fulfilled your wish yet.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:13.430
If I don't fulfill your 
wish now, you'll die.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.630
Huh?

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:17.630
I won't die.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.470
A dream?

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:25.100
Talk about bad omens.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:26.920
I guess my streak 
of bad luck isn't over.

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:27.730
Don't move.

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:31.980
I'll save you. You're my hope.

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:37.030
You are my hope, as well... 
Actually, my wish.

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:41.740
Being Ixion means to be 
like a god on some level.

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:44.120
You are my goddess.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:47.560
But we're not omnipotent like gods.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.470
Still, we are responsible 
for this world.

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:51.420
That's why I called you.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:55.010
Don't worry, I'm the type of 
guy who takes responsibility.

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:56.420
It's done.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:58.510
Ah, yes. Thank you.

00:20:00.230 --> 00:20:01.490
Be gone!

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.420
What?! You, too?

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:06.010
I removed the poison, 
but your bad luck persists.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.770
What should I do?

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:11.060
Your friends are preparing 
for that outside.

00:20:16.390 --> 00:20:17.390
What is that?

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.420
A tool for curing you.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:22.910
You've basically been 
cursed multiple times.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:25.850
You'll need a ritual of a certain 
caliber to lift those curses.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:28.830
I built it in a flash, but it 
turned out pretty well, huh?

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.350
First the holy water from a pure maiden.

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:34.550
But Sis, you're not a maiden.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:36.390
I'll be doing it.

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:39.390
Being a divorcée doesn't 
have any influence on that?

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:43.300
Don't be like that, get up there.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.560
Where is that holy water?

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.320
Let's begin.

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:01.240
So this is the purifying water?

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:05.110
Lift it! Purify him!

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:08.390
It's warm. That feels good.

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:12.240
This bath is great.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.500
Ouch. It's getting a bit hot.

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:18.080
Looks like the purification ritual 
is in the final stage now.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:21.070
Now all we can do is watch.

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.590
Hey, it's hot!

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:25.800
Kon, you have to flip 
over the pot by yourself!

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.010
What?!

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:30.380
You need to pour the holy 
water onto the holy flames!

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:32.270
That'll conclude the ritual!

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.710
This is impossible! Help! Ow!

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:38.780
If we help you, the ritual will fail.

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:40.480
Come on!

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:42.050
Be gone!

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.270
Be gone!

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:44.490
Be gone!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:46.240
Be gone!

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:51.480
All the rituals in this 
world are like this!

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:54.340
I'm going back to 
Mitaka, no matter what!

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:56.290
Oh crap, I said it!

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:58.160
The ritual isn't over yet?

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:00.090
It's up to him.

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:02.720
We don't even have an hour to spare now.

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:04.630
If we don't stop it, 
the war will begin soon.

00:22:06.780 --> 00:22:08.300
But Kon is still...

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:10.020
We don't even have an hour to spare now.

00:22:18.810 --> 00:22:20.690
Did I do it?

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:23.700
Yes, you did it! You're great!

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:27.700
Shh. What's important is how he feels.

00:22:27.930 --> 00:22:31.200
All right! Goodbye, bad luck!

00:22:31.750 --> 00:22:36.400
Now nothing stands 
between me and the battle!

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:38.550
Be gone!

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:24.860
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.710 --> 00:24:15.060
The armies of Jugglaburk and St. 
Piria are amassing in Sarisariñama.

00:24:15.060 --> 00:24:17.490
We're trying to stop the war,

00:24:17.490 --> 00:24:20.350
but our path is blocked by the Ulga 
Sorority's Ulbrion troops.

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:23.480
Oh no! At this rate the war will begin!

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:29.650
Will they be able to prevent the war?

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:29.650
And will Kon get his "ultimate wish"?

00:24:29.650 --> 00:24:34.560
The story is finally progressing 
in "Ixion Saga DT."

00:24:29.650 --> 00:24:34.560
Actually, there are only two 
episodes left. Say what?!
